{
  "id": "2026-10-30-aiplatform-v1beta1",
  "date": "2026-10-30",
  "api": "aiplatform.v1beta1",
  "service": "Vertex AI",
  "title": "AI Platform v1beta1: Major Breaking Changes & New File/Embedding APIs",
  "summary": "This update brings significant breaking changes, including the removal of `evaluationTasks.operations` and a rollback of `continuationToken` in `GenaiVertexV1beta1Interaction`. Developers must update their code. On the feature side, new file management and batch embedding capabilities are now available, alongside enhancements to video generation.",
  "details": "This Vertex AI v1beta1 update introduces several critical breaking changes. The entire `evaluationTasks.operations` resource and its methods (`delete`, `get`, `list`, `wait`) have been removed, requiring immediate code updates for any integrations relying on these. Furthermore, the `continuationToken` property in `GenaiVertexV1beta1Interaction`, which was recently added to support resuming long-running content generation, has been removed, rolling back this feature. Developers will need to revert any code changes made to utilize this token.\n\nAdditional breaking changes include several parameters becoming strictly required: `name` for `projects.locations.publishers.files.delete`, `download`, and `get`; `parent` and `publishersId` for `projects.locations.publishers.files.list`; and `model` for `projects.locations.publishers.models.batchEmbedContents`. Also, the `aiApplication` property in `GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Agent` and multiple fields within `GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ClaudeFile` (including `created_at`, `downloadable`, `expires_at`, `filename`, `id`, `mime_type`, `size_bytes`, and `type`) are now read-only.\n\nOn the feature front, a new `files` resource has been added under `projects.locations.publishers`, providing `delete`, `download`, `get`, and `list` methods for managing Claude files. The `list` method supports paginated or batch fetching by `ids`. The `projects.locations.publishers.models` resource now includes a `batchEmbedContents` method, enabling efficient batch embedding of content. The `projects.locations.agents.create` method gains an optional `idpNonce` parameter for enhanced session and device non-repudiation. Video generation experiments (`CloudAiLargeModelsVisionGenerateVideoExperiments`) are extended with a new `perfEstimationConfig` for performance estimation, including `BoundingBox` and `CharacterReference` details. Finally, `GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GenerateContentRequest` now supports an `outputConfig` field, allowing you to specify an `outputUriPrefix` for generated content.",
  "impact": "high",
  "breaking": true,
  "interesting_score": 9,
  "tags": [
    "breaking-change",
    "ai",
    "vertex-ai",
    "files",
    "embedding",
    "video-generation",
    "agents"
  ],
